<title>JAPAN: Nippon Credit Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Credit Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	   560.89		vs	  683.83</p>
<p> Operating	   53.61		vs	   96.12</p>
<p> Current		6.16		vs	   18.38</p>
<p> Net		    8.06		vs	    6.61</p>
<p> EPS		    4.65 yen	  vs	    3.81 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.74 billion	  vs	1.74 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Credit Bank Ltd lends to the housing and distribution industries, as well as loans to businesses.</p>
</text>
